# Copy to .env.local (or .env) and fill in from your Supabase project's
# Settings > API page. Both are safe to ship to the client — access control
# is enforced by Postgres row-level security (see supabase/schema.sql), not
# by keeping the anon key secret.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
